{
  "bookId": "hero-212002",
  "id": "bond-27500",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27500001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这朵花是哪来的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "小区花圃里摘的！很新鲜，还挂着露水！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那，这些石头呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "公园的鹅卵石地上挖出来的，颜色最饱满的几颗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这些东西不可以拿回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "为什么？你不喜欢它们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27500008",
              "text": "它们属于所有人。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27500008",
              "text": "你会给别人造成困扰的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27500007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "这，这样吗......对不起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "其实，玲不需要送我什么东西，我会也一样喜欢玲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "在玲原来的世界，拥有足够的物资才能活下去。\n嘿嘿，可能是做惯了快递员，每天总想送点什么给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "而且......在给你送东西的时候，玲会有种安心的感觉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "别、别这样看我啦，我现在就把它们放回去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "......玲，等一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "以后每天请你帮我取报纸和牛奶，可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27500015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "嗯......嗯？好啊好啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
